================================================================================
RESEARCH / DEVELOPMENT NOTICE — NOT A REGULATED GAMBLING SERVICE
================================================================================

This is a reference implementation of an academic / research protocol for a
dealerless, peer-to-peer card-game state machine on Bitcoin SV (post-Genesis).
Per the project's CLAUDE.md (rule "Token Model"), tokens used in this system
carry NO external monetary value. The application is NOT a regulated gambling
service, NOT a casino product, and NOT a wallet for real-money play. Do not
deploy it as one without obtaining your own legal and regulatory advice in
the jurisdictions of your operators and players.
